      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Pegloticase (pegylated recombinant uricase) = given IV Q2wks for many months, mainly when other treatments haven't lowered urate or there = a heavy burden of tophi."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
